:"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2014-12-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=I%20must%20insist%20we%20continue%20to%20the%20capital.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Bond and Blood\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"bond-and-blood-2014-12-03-e7","era":null,"summary":"Anafenza lashes out at Gvar, insisting they are not family, and he replies that neither chose their family.","participants":["anafenza","gvar-barzeel"],"location":"salt-road","importance":"minor","page":"stories/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","order":474,"story_date":"2014-12-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":55,"quote":"We're not cousins, Gvar! We're not even family!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=We%27re%20not%20cousins%2C%20Gvar%21%20We%27re%20not%20even%20family%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Bond and Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2014-12-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=We%27re%20not%20cousins%2C%20Gvar%21%20We%27re%20not%20even%20family%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Bond and Blood\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"bond-and-blood-2014-12-03-e8","era":null,"summary":"Hakrez, the kin-tree warden, teaches Anafenza that the kin-tree belongs to blood-kin and bond-kin alike.","participants":["hakrez","anafenza"],"location":"salt-road","importance":"minor","page":"stories/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","order":474,"story_date":"2014-12-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":73,"quote":"This tree belongs to all of them.","link":"https://magic.wiza